@startuml

title Simulación - Infraestructura de ejecución

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false

skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam classFontSize 18
skinparam classAttributeFontSize 15
skinparam classMethodFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14

skinparam packageTitleFontSize 16
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam Padding 8

skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 20


class SimulationRunner {
    + run(...) : SimulationResult
}


package "Infraestructura de red" as PKG_NETWORK {

    class UdpGatewayServer {
        + run()
        + stop()
        + sendDownlink(...)
    }

    class TcpGatewayServer {
        + run()
        + stop()
    }

    class Gateway {
        + receiveUdpMessage(...)
        + receiveTcpMessage(...)
        + sendDownlink(...)
    }

    class NetworkServer {
        + registerDevice(...)
        + registerGateway(...)
        + receiveFromGateway(...)
    }

    UdpGatewayServer -[hidden]right- TcpGatewayServer
    TcpGatewayServer -[hidden]right- Gateway
    Gateway -[hidden]right- NetworkServer
}


class Device {
    - deviceId : String
    - currentSpreadingFactor : int
    - confirmed : boolean

    + sendUplink(...)
}


SimulationRunner --> NetworkServer : crea y configura
SimulationRunner --> Gateway : crea
SimulationRunner --> UdpGatewayServer : inicia
SimulationRunner --> TcpGatewayServer : inicia
SimulationRunner --> Device : crea y registra

UdpGatewayServer --> Gateway : entrega UDP
TcpGatewayServer --> Gateway : entrega TCP

Gateway --> NetworkServer : reenvía uplink

Device -- Gateway : asociado


note bottom of SimulationRunner
Coordina la creación y el
ciclo de vida de la infraestructura.
end note

@enduml